<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhīpaei</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhīphaei</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rīp-</span></b> ), montes, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a range of mountains in the most
				northern part of Scythia</i>, <i>where are the
				sources of the Tanais</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1,
				19, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 1,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 5, 1</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				4, 12, 24, § 78</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 5, 5, § 15</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Enn.
				Ann. 4, 5 al.</span></i> — Less freq. in
			sing.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhipaeus mons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					1, 19, 18</span></i>
			 and 20.— Hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhī-paeus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhīphaeus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rīp-</span></b> ), a, um,
				adj., <i>Rhiphæan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 240</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Eurus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 382</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pruinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 518</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">grando,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 1, 420</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nives,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					4, 118</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bruma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 603</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 10, 77</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					1, 19, 13</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 1,
		1</span></i>.</div>
